<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kuhlman rated attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kuhlman rated attractive.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Walter Kirchberger initiated coverage of Kuhlman Corp with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>-- the stock was flat at 32-5/8.</p>
</text>
